 160:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** /*=================================================================================================
 161:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Name      : e_ErrSort DiagGetFilErrSortAPI(e_ERR_ID id)
 162:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Input     : id:故障ID
 163:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Output    : 故障类型[0,8]
 164:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Function  : 获取故障类型
