 306:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Name      : void DiagSetErrFilStateAPI(e_ERR_ID id, e_ErrState state)
 307:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Input     : id:故障ID state:目标故障状态
 308:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Output    : void
