 371:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Name      : e_ErrState DiagGetErrLastStateAPI(e_ERR_ID id)
 372:./Application/Funtion/SystemDiag/SystemDiag.c **** ** @Input     : id:故障ID
